  "review_summary": "The corrected rationale addresses all three error targets. It removes the incorrect claim that broad category labels constitute concrete details, removes the unsupported inference that authors know how to implement the action, and removes the incorrect score mapping to score 4. The rationale correctly characterizes the comment as having an implicitly stated action that is vague and lacks detail on how to apply it. It preserves the unrelated correct reasoning about the action being implicit and inferable from criticism. No numeric score or gold label is stated, and the rationale can be coherently inserted into a Qwen3-4B rescoring context."
